<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GT Bicycles EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GT Bicycles EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Friday it reduced its 1997 Q1 earnings per share estimate on GT Bicycles Inc to $0.09 from $0.24, citing a delay in shipments of more than 30,000 bikes by the company.</p>
<p>--However, EVEREN said it raied its Q2 EPS view to $0.33 from $0.26. Its full-year projection was trimmed to $1.15 from $1.10. The 1998 estimate is unchanged at $1.38.</p>
<p>--BT Bicycles was up 1-1/8 at 9-1/8.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
